+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (SemVer), with releases numbered as MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH. This decision reverses an earlier, since-abandoned adoption of Calendar Versioning (CalVer), as SemVer was judged to give clearer signal about API compatibility and release scope than a date-based scheme.
